## Changes

- `web/src/lib/session-filter.ts`: new `sessionMatchesQuery()` helper. Case-insensitive substring match against the session `id`/`file` (the title shown in the list, e.g. `2026-11-05-standup-0930`) and the started date in both raw ISO and `toLocaleString()` forms. Empty/whitespace queries match everything, so clearing the input restores the full list.
- `web/src/lib/session-filter.test.ts`: 5 unit tests covering empty query, case-insensitive id match, both date formats, whitespace trimming, and `started_at: null`.
- `web/src/pages/Sessions.tsx`: controlled `Input` with a `Search` icon at the top of the card, filters on every keystroke via `filtered = sessions.filter(...)`. When nothing matches it shows the existing `Empty`/`EmptyMedia`/`EmptyTitle` components with a "No matching sessions" message. Same shadcn/ui components and styling as the rest of the page.

